#: ../../source/janim/timeline/subtitles.rst:2
msgid "subtitles"
msgstr "subtitles"

#: janim.timeline.subtitles.SubtitleInfo:1 of
msgid "调用 :meth:`~.Timeline.subtitle` 的参数信息"
msgstr "Parameter information for calling :meth:`~.Timeline.subtitle`"

#: janim.timeline.subtitles.SubtitlesMixin:1 of
msgid "向 :class:`~.Timeline`  提供添加字幕的功能"
msgstr "Provides the ability to add subtitles to :class:`~.Timeline`"

#: janim.timeline.subtitles.SubtitlesMixin:5 of
msgid "该类中的方法都可以直接在 :class:`~.Timeline` 中使用"
msgstr "All methods in this class can be used directly in :class:`~.Timeline`"

#: janim.timeline.subtitles.SubtitlesMixin.subtitle:1 of
msgid "添加字幕"
msgstr "Add subtitle"

#: janim.timeline.subtitles.SubtitlesMixin.subtitle:3 of
msgid "文字可以传入一个列表，纵向排列显示"
msgstr "Text can be passed as a list, displayed vertically"

#: janim.timeline.subtitles.SubtitlesMixin.subtitle:4 of
msgid "可以指定在当前位置往后 ``delay`` 秒才显示"
msgstr "You can specify that the subtitle appears ``delay`` seconds after the current position"

#: janim.timeline.subtitles.SubtitlesMixin.subtitle:5 of
msgid "``duration`` 表示持续时间"
msgstr "``duration`` represents the duration"

#: janim.timeline.subtitles.SubtitlesMixin.subtitle:6 of
msgid "``scale`` 表示对文字的缩放，可以传入列表表示对各个文字的缩放"
msgstr "``scale`` represents the scaling of text. You can pass a list to specify scaling for each text"

#: janim.timeline.subtitles.SubtitlesMixin.subtitle:7 of
msgid "``use_typst_text`` 表示是否使用 :class:`TypstText`，可以传入列表表示各个文字是否使用"
msgstr ""
"``use_typst_text`` indicates whether to use :class:`TypstText`. You can pass a list to specify whether each text uses it"

#: janim.timeline.subtitles.SubtitlesMixin.subtitle:8 of
msgid "将 ``surrounding_alpha`` 设置为 ``0`` 可以禁用附带的底框"
msgstr "Set ``surrounding_alpha`` to ``0`` to disable the background box"

#: janim.timeline.subtitles.SubtitlesMixin.subtitle:10 of
msgid ":class:`~.Config` 中也提供了一些可以配置的参数："
msgstr ":class:`~.Config` also provides some configurable parameters:"

#: janim.timeline.subtitles.SubtitlesMixin.subtitle:12 of
msgid "``subtitle_font`` 可全局配置字幕所使用的字体"
msgstr "``subtitle_font`` globally configures the font used for subtitles"

#: janim.timeline.subtitles.SubtitlesMixin.subtitle:13 of
msgid "``subtitle_to_edge_buff`` 可配置字幕离底边的距离，默认是 ``DEFAULT_ITEM_TO_EDGE_BUFF``"
msgstr ""
"``subtitle_to_edge_buff`` configures the distance from the subtitle to the bottom edge; defaults to "
"``DEFAULT_ITEM_TO_EDGE_BUFF``"

#: janim.timeline.subtitles.SubtitlesMixin.subtitle:15 of
msgid "返回值表示显示的时间段"
msgstr "Return value represents the display time range"

#: janim.timeline.subtitles.SubtitlesMixin.place_subtitle:1 of
msgid "被 :meth:`subtitle` 调用以将字幕放置到合适的位置："
msgstr "Called by :meth:`subtitle` to place subtitles in appropriate positions:"

#: janim.timeline.subtitles.SubtitlesMixin.place_subtitle:3 of
msgid "对于同一批添加的字幕 ``[a, b]``，则 ``a`` 放在 ``b`` 的上面"
msgstr "For subtitles added in the same batch ``[a, b]``, ``a`` is placed above ``b``"

#: janim.timeline.subtitles.SubtitlesMixin.place_subtitle:4 of
msgid "如果在上文所述的 ``[a, b]`` 仍存在时，又加入了一个 ``c``，则 ``c`` 放在最上面"
msgstr "If ``[a, b]`` mentioned above still exists and a ``c`` is added, then ``c`` is placed at the top"
